WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:42.220
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:49.310
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:54.110
<i>continue their journey to stop the bringer
of ruin and darkness, Millenniumon.</i>

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:59.490
<i>They gather their friends as they head
for the Eternal Continent's center, FAGA.</i>

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:10.080
<i>After defeating the Digimon threatening
the underwater city,</i>

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:13.630
<i>Taichi's party carries on farther
through the sea route.</i>

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:22.740
THE GLOWING ANGEWOMON

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.520
How far is this going to continue?

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.480
Some scary Digimon might appear again.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:37.760
Whatever appears, we can take them!

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.090
Oh?

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:45.010
Ah, you know that's called
"a lack of worry."

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.520
A lack of worry?

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.830
<i>Yeah, that's what Sora said!</i>

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.150
<i>Really.</i>

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:52.330
Agumon, how you doing?

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.210
<i>Excellent!</i>

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:58.530
<i>It's amazing to be able to breathe
and talk underwater!</i>

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:03.050
It's all thanks to Marinangemon
for sharing this power with everyone.

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.550
Takeru, you can do it too.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:09.040
Then me and Patamon
will be the lookout next.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.540
<i>Okay!</i>

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:15.730
We just pass through this sea cave
and then rise to the surface, right?

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:18.860
Yes, let's proceed carefully.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.800
According to Marinangemon,

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.930
<i>the Digimon that were attacking
the underwater city...</i>

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:28.430
<i>They seem to be coming from just up ahead.</i>

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.140
Is there a nest?

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:34.900
I don't know, but...

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.460
<i>What is this
unsettling feeling in my heart?</i>

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.910
<i>I sense something terrible up ahead.</i>

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.700
Tailmon?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.950
No, it's nothing, Hikari.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.980
Taichi, I see something!

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.290
There's lots of them!

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:05.030
We've seen them before!

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:07.720
They were... Chikurimon!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:13.560
They're small, but these Digimon explode
like a mine when they hit you.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.060
It'll be bad if they surround us!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.620
Baby Flame!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.450
Magical Fire!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.710
Air Shot!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.440
We can fight even underwater!

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.210
But there's no end to them!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:44.970
A new enemy!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:52.980
Ebidramon!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.730
Agumon!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.610
Agumon Evolution!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.540
Greymon!

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.300
Patamon!

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.300
Okay!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.360
Sora!

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.230
No!

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:24.420
What?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:28.430
Taichi, watch out for Chikurimon's moves!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.920
If you evolve to fight Ebidramon,

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:45.240
your large body becomes
Chikurimon's perfect target!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.160
Taichi! Greymon!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.000
Hikari!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.800
Tailmon... thank you.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:07.800
Hikari...

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:13.010
All of you! I'll show you no mercy!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.290
Tailmon.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.040
Neko Punch!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.550
Huh?!

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:56.560
Isn't this...

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.060
Tailmon, watch out! It's an evolution!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.520
An evolution...

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.590
GUSOKUMON

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.270
Gusokumon... an Ultimate Digimon.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:45.770
Tailmon!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.780
Tailmon!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.570
Tailmon!

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:08.000
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.930
Metalgreymon!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.730
Giga Destroyer!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:26.210
Giga Storm!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:54.250
<i>Just earlier, the space center
has announced that the ISS is falling</i>

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.610
<i>from its orbital path
due to an accident!</i>

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:01.090
The ISS's altitude is estimated
to be at 100,000 feet!

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:04.790
Moscow's Motion Control System
will not stabilize!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.600
<i>What about Houston's system?</i>

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.380
<i>It's not operating!</i>

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:18.130
Houston and Moscow's space centers
are in trouble too.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.640
What a disaster!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.120
<i>No matter what,
we must prevent it from falling!</i>

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.830
The point of impact is Tokyo!

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.200
Where in Tokyo?!

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:29.640
We can't specify!

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:32.810
This is...

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.660
Tailmon...

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.670
Yes... I am Tailmon.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:54.920
I am...

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.760
the Holy Digimon.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:06.930
<i>In order to fulfill that role,
and for the upcoming battles...</i>

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.430
<i>I must be like everyone else.</i>

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:12.650
I must evolve further to become stronger.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.860
That rise in power I felt earlier...

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.030
That must've been the sign to evolve.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.370
But I couldn't do it.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:25.910
Fear...

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:30.910
I am afraid to evolve.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.880
I still remember...

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.590
Long ago...

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:44.430
<i>I fought and defeated Millenniumon
in exchange for my own life.</i>

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:47.950
<i>The puppet to resurrect Millenniumon,</i>

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.850
<i>Skullknightmon...</i>

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.100
<i>and Darkknightmon.</i>

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.310
That was me.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:12:00.400
<i>That cold, black armor was the shell
that trapped me inside.</i>

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:06.870
But still, Darkknightmon was myself
and I was Darkknightmon.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.200
That destructive drive
that desired darkness

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:14.540
unmistakably existed
as one of my own emotions.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.380
I am afraid...

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.900
Even after I've been released
from darkness now,

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:26.180
what if a shard of evil remains
inside my heart?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:32.040
If that grows
and tries to swallow my mind and body,

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.600
I will once again...

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:43.740
Wow!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.240
Taichi-san, we're out of the cave!

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:54.120
Hikari, Tailmon, we're gonna resurface,
so come inside for now.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.590
Tailmon.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.510
Something's coming.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.790
Mega Flame!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:44.800
Tailmon, you all right?!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:48.050
Y-Yeah... where's Hikari?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.700
I don't know. She won't respond to me.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.560
We gotta hurry and find her!

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:54.970
<i>Taichi!</i>

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.690
<i>Sora! Birdramon!</i>

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.280
Me and Pegasmon's here too!

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:03.650
And your side?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.150
Greymon and Tailmon are with me.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.820
But Hikari is...

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.580
Komondomon's in danger here.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.210
Isn't this...

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.940
There's no mistake.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:26.710
That's the source of the power
that made Ebidramon evolve!

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:32.470
<i>The Digimon that attacked the underwater
city must've been born here too.</i>

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.260
Hikari...

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:39.980
This way!

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:41.980
Tailmon!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.880
<i>You look for Hikari-chan!</i>

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:44.960
Right!

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.730
-Let's go!
-Yeah!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.240
Hikari!

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.240
Hikari!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.520
Isn't this...

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:03.790
Careful! This place is overflowing
with dark energy!

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:09.510
What is that?!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:14.260
MARINDEVIMON

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.020
Hikari!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:31.260
I knew it! Millenniumon's shard!

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.450
It wants Hikari and me again.

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:44.040
Greymon!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.260
Hikari!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.090
Hikari!

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.990
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:58.430
Hikari.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.770
Unforgivable!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.780
Tailmon, wait!

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:12.800
Greymon!

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:13.780
Right!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.540
Tailmon!

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.050
Wait, Tailmon!

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.600
Greymon...

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.400
You shall...

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.110
not interfere!

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.590
No, Tailmon!

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:27.060
Hikari...

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.530
Tailmon.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.370
No, Tailmon.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.500
Don't worry.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.130
When you feel scared...

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.380
When you do...

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.840
When you do, call for me.

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.560
Tailmon, you have me.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:06.180
I'll rescue you every time.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.150
That's why...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.700
it'll be okay.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.120
I have...

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.200
Hikari.

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:32.040
Hikari will light my way...

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.690
and guide me out of darkness.

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:38.090
The light.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.810
That's right.

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:46.810
That's why... that is your name.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.100
Hikari...

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.080
Hikari.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.960
I will no longer...

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.130
be afraid.

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.380
I won't lose my way.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:18.980
Now is the time to unleash
all my powers with Hikari!

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:21.340
Yeah, Tailmon.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:30.890
Tailmon Super Evolution!

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.080
Angewomon!

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.670
ANGEWOMON

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.880
Angewomon.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.930
Angewomon, together...

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.480
Let's fight!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.940
Heaven's Charm!

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:23.630
Hikari!

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:24.610
Yeah!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.450
Holy Arrow!

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:53.180
The distortion born
from Millenniumon's shard...

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:54.730
Begone!

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:19.610
<i>Taichi-san, can you hear me?</i>

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:23.900
<i>I've found a way to stop the ISS's fall!</i>

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:27.740
<i>There's no time! Please lend me a hand!</i>

00:22:31.180 --> 00:22:32.890
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:35.600
<i>Angewomon.</i>

00:22:35.770 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>This Digimon super evolves from Tailmon.</i>

00:22:35.770 --> 00:22:38.500
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.920
TYPE: ARCHANGEL

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:43.190
<i>Angewomon shoots special
Holy Arrows with a white bow.</i>

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:43.340
SPECIAL MOVE: HOLY ARROW / HEAVEN'S CHARM

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:45.440
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:50.990
<i>Angewomon is like a goddess,
but shows no mercy to evil.</i>

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:54.950
<i>People who are normally like angels
are scary when they get angry.</i>

00:22:57.580 --> 00:23:00.000
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:07.420
<i>To stop the ISS from falling,
Koshiro takes a huge gamble.</i>

00:23:07.590 --> 00:23:11.340
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Operation Satellite Sniper"</i>

00:23:11.510 --> 00:23:14.430
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
